From 4ce7dbe7363882459ddc8647a0f1c9f5fb746ac6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:24:59 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(goldens): judge the slot, trace and plasma goldens
 by their gates

Five of the six posted goldens #862 left in UNJUDGED are now run
through the gate their kind's post runs (tests/posted_gates/):
the two slot goldens and trochoid_slot_small through verify in
Mode::Area against the stadium operation::region_of builds for a real
Slot / TrochoidalSlot op; trace_plate_with_hole through verify in
Mode::Engrave against the plate's section as region_of builds it for
a Trace op; plasma_plate_with_holes through the plasma laws
(verify::plasma::judge), as the plasma post clause runs them. Each
program is proved byte-identical to its CL golden first. All five
verify clean - no golden moved, none was regenerated.

the_slot_gate_bites shows the harness convicts a slot program judged
against a narrower stadium. The posted-golden guard now counts the
blocking findings of all three gate families. arc_planes stays in
UNJUDGED with a precise reason (a hand-built posting fixture no op,
part or region makes); the gap is #1093.

Fixes #1000

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
